# Flashback targets an instant or sorcery card in *your* graveyard: with Bot1's graveyard holding only Black Lotus (an artifact)
# and Bot2's holding a Lightning Bolt it casts at Bot1, Flashback is not offered on turn 3 although Bot1 has {R}{R}{R} floating
# (no legal target). Once Bot1's own Lightning Bolt is in its graveyard - the positive control - Flashback is cast on it, and
# the Bolt is cast from the graveyard: Bot2 takes 3 twice, Bot1 once.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Flashback
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
